    "scenesThatPass": [
      "STACY: Maybe you should just be honest, sweetie.\nSTACY: You could say: look, I don't know anything about these either, so now we're gonna read them together and sort of teach each other as we go. …\nAMY: Why would they hire you if you haven't read the books?",
      "AMY: It's annoying.\nSTACY: So she became a prostitute.\nAMY: It's tedious and boring. And once they start, it's impossible to get them to stop.",
      "STACY: It's beautiful.\nAMY: So beautiful.\nSTACY: And the mosquitoes are gone. You realize that? They've stopped biting. She smiles at the others, delighted by this development. Amy removes …",
      "AMY: But what will we eat? How will we-- The RINGING comes again, silencing her. She glances toward the shaft, not quite believing what she's hea…\nSTACY: A cell phone.\nAMY: It can't be--",
      "AMY: Wait... She pauses, lifting the torch, but Stacy keeps going. Amy peers at the vine hanging from the wall. There's a fifth RING, echoing eer…\nAMY: Stacy... The shaft dead-ends at a blank wall, which is just materializing out of the darkness, fifteen feet in front of them. There's a sixt…\nSTACY: It's right here. I can-- Amy jumps forward, reaching for her."
    ]
  },
